out.push("\n\n### 4.1 ::backdrop\n\n原生模态 dialog 提供了专门的遮罩伪元素。\n\n```css\ndialog::backdrop {\n  background: rgb(0 0 0 / 50%);\n}\n```\n\n也可以实现背景模糊：\n\n```css\ndialog::backdrop {\n  background: rgb(0 0 0 / 40%);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(4px);\n}\n```\n\n不再需要单独创建一个全屏遮罩 div。\n\n不过，遮罩负责视觉表现，真正的背景交互隔离来自 showModal() 的原生模态行为。\n\n---\n\n## 5. 实战一：原生 Size Guide Modal\n\n先实现一个完整的、可以直接在普通 HTML 页面中运行的尺寸说明弹窗。\n\n### 5.1 HTML\n\n```html\n<button\n  id=\"open-size-guide\"\n  type=\"button\"\n  aria-haspopup=\"dialog\"\n>\n  Size guide\n</button>\n\n<dialog\n  id=\"size-guide\"\n  aria-labelledby=\"size-guide-title\"\n>\n  <header class=\"modal-header\">\n    <h2\n      id=\"size-guide-title\"\n      tabindex=\"-1\"\n      autofocus\n    >\n      Size guide\n    </h2>\n\n    <button\n      type=\"button\"\n      data-close\n      aria-label=\"Close size guide\"\n    >\n      ×\n    </button>\n  </header>\n\n  <p>All measurements are in centimeters.</p>\n\n  <table>\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th scope=\"col\">Size</th>\n        <th scope=\"col\">Chest</th>\n        <th scope=\"col\">Length</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <th scope=\"row\">S</th>\n        <td>96</td>\n        <td>66</td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr>\n        <th scope=\"row\">M</th>\n        <td>100</td>\n        <td>68</td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr>\n        <th scope=\"row\">L</th>\n        <td>104</td>\n        <td>70</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</dialog>\n```\n\n### 5.2 CSS\n\n```css\ndialog {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  width: min(600px, calc(100% - 32px));\n\n  max-height: 85vh;\n  max-height: 85dvh;\n\n  overflow: auto;\n  overscroll-behavior: contain;\n\n  padding: 24px;\n  border: 0;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n}\n\ndialog::backdrop {\n  background: rgb(0 0 0 / 50%);\n}\n\n.modal-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n\n.modal-header button {\n  min-width: 44px;\n  min-height: 44px;\n}\n\ndialog table {\n  width: 100%;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\n}\n\ndialog th,\ndialog td {\n  padding: 12px 6px;\n  text-align: start;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #999;\n}\n\ndialog :focus-visible {\n  outline: 2px solid #005fcc;\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\n```\n\n### 5.3 JavaScript\n\n```javascript\nconst dialog = document.querySelector('#size-guide');\n\nconst trigger = document.querySelector(\n  '#open-size-guide'\n);\n\nconst closeButton = dialog.querySelector('[data-close]');\n\ntrigger.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  if (!dialog.open) {\n    dialog.showModal();\n  }\n});\n\ncloseButton.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  dialog.close();\n});\n```\n\n就这样，最基础的原生模态弹窗已经实现。\n\n");
