out.push("\n\n### 8.1 HTML 实现\n\n```html\n<dialog\n  id=\"delete-address-dialog\"\n  role=\"alertdialog\"\n  aria-labelledby=\"delete-title\"\n  aria-describedby=\"delete-description\"\n>\n  <h2 id=\"delete-title\">\n    Remove saved address?\n  </h2>\n\n  <p id=\"delete-description\">\n    This address will be permanently\n    removed from your account.\n  </p>\n\n  <form method=\"dialog\">\n    <button\n      type=\"submit\"\n      value=\"cancel\"\n      autofocus\n    >\n      Cancel\n    </button>\n\n    <button\n      type=\"submit\"\n      value=\"confirm\"\n    >\n      Remove\n    </button>\n  </form>\n</dialog>\n```\n\n这里有三个值得学习的设计。\n\n第一，使用 `role=\"alertdialog\"` 表达需要用户响应的重要对话框。\n\n第二，通过 `aria-describedby` 关联简短的风险说明。\n\n第三，将初始焦点放在 Cancel 按钮上，降低意外执行破坏性操作的风险。这也符合 APG 对难以撤销操作的焦点设计建议。");
