out.push("\n\n### 9.1 HTML 结构\n\n```html\n<dialog\n  id=\"cart-drawer\"\n  class=\"drawer\"\n  aria-labelledby=\"cart-title\"\n>\n  <div class=\"drawer-layout\">\n\n    <header class=\"drawer-header\">\n      <h2 id=\"cart-title\" tabindex=\"-1\" autofocus>\n        Your cart\n      </h2>\n\n      <button\n        type=\"button\"\n        data-close\n        aria-label=\"Close shopping cart\"\n      >\n        ×\n      </button>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"drawer-body\">\n      <div id=\"cart-items\">\n        <!-- AJAX cart items -->\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <footer class=\"drawer-footer\">\n      <!-- Cart total and checkout -->\n    </footer>\n\n    <p\n      id=\"cart-status\"\n      role=\"status\"\n      class=\"visually-hidden\"\n    ></p>\n\n    <p\n      id=\"cart-error\"\n      role=\"alert\"\n    ></p>\n\n  </div>\n</dialog>\n```\n\n注意，Live Region 位于 dialog 内部，但处于经常被 Section Rendering 替换的 cart-items 区域之外。\n\n这就是上一课动态通知知识的实际应用。\n\n### 9.2 CSS 实现右侧抽屉\n\n```css\ndialog.drawer {\n  position: fixed;\n  inset: 0 0 0 auto;\n\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n\n  width: min(100%, 480px);\n  max-width: none;\n\n  height: 100vh;\n  height: 100dvh;\n  max-height: 100dvh;\n\n  border: 0;\n  border-radius: 0;\n\n  overflow: auto;\n  overscroll-behavior: contain;\n}\n\n.drawer-layout {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  min-height: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n}\n\n.drawer-header,\n.drawer-footer {\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.drawer-body {\n  flex: 1;\n  min-height: 0;\n  overflow-y: auto;\n  overscroll-behavior: contain;\n}\n\n.drawer::backdrop {\n  background: rgb(0 0 0 / 50%);\n}\n```\n\n");
